ALVA — Completely Remove Combo Assist and Combat Assist

Objective

Perform a complete, permanent removal of Combo Assist and Combat Assist from Alva.

Repository: hiyroscript/alva
Branch: main

This is a full feature-removal and code-cleanup task, not a request to disable, hide, or default either feature to Off.

Both systems must cease to exist as gameplay mechanics, settings, state, UI features, and active code dependencies.

Do not introduce replacement assist systems. Do not redesign the combat engine or change the established manual combat mechanics.

The finished game must provide fully manual attacks, with the player deciding which attacks to perform and positioning their fighter themselves.

