2. Completely remove Combo Assist

Current behavior

Combo Assist currently provides two automated behaviors:

Automatic attack alternation

When Attack 1 has finished but is still on cooldown, pressing Attack 1 again can request Attack 2 instead. Attack 2 can similarly redirect to Attack 1.

Automatic queued follow-ups

Pressing the button for an attack already playing can queue its paired attack. Once the original attack finishes, the game attempts to execute the queued attack, potentially holding it briefly while its cooldown expires.

Both behaviors must be deleted completely.

