* Combo Assist is entirely removed.
* Combat Assist is entirely removed.
* Neither feature is accessible or stored.
* Attack 1 and Attack 2 always retain their own input identities.
* No automatic attack follow-up or pre-attack opponent approach exists.
* Existing manual combos and combat cancellation still work.
* Character-authored attacks and legitimate movement mechanics are preserved.
* Keyboard, touch, and controller input remain functional.
* Quick Battle, Practice Ground, Watch Mode, and CPU behavior remain functional.
